    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ilaisiaayak le Nkai",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore etiu neijia, lalashera laainei, maidim apa airorie intae anaa ltung'ana ootamanya enkiyang'et e Nkai kake anaa ltung'anak ake, anaa nkera kutiti ti atua Kristo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.5.12+HEB.5.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ilh 5.12-13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kule aitotiyie intae, mme endaa nagol, amu mindimidimi apa aainosa ina neton doi ake mindimidimi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "amu eton aa enoshi ake netii lkulikae tung'ana itii. Amaa te neton etii olom o enchankar atua intae, aimirara intae ilo sesen? Neton inkunariri ake anaa lkulikae tung'ana? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CO.1.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Ilkor 1.12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Amu ore pee eaku kejo likae, “Ara nanu ole Paulo,” nejo likae, “Ara nanu ole Apolos,” nyorrikiki naa mirara iltung'ana ake? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ainyoo ninye Apolos? Ainyoo ninye Paulo? Kira ake sinkan laa te ninche ietuo intae aairuk. Neeta ake oltung'ani ina naa Olaitoriani oishoo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.18.4+ACT.18.5+ACT.18.6+ACT.18.7+ACT.18.8+ACT.18.9+ACT.18.10+ACT.18.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Iat 18.4-11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.18.24+ACT.18.25+ACT.18.26+ACT.18.27+ACT.18.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "24-28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nanu otuuno, nepik Apolos enkare, kake Enkai naitubulua lelo ng'anayio. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neaku mme toki ilo otuno neme toki olotipika enkare, kake Enkai nara naitubulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erisio ake olaunoni o lopik enkare, naa keyooki ake oltung'ani atum olekoisiaayio lenye eiririkino esiaai enye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kira iyiook ilaisiaayiak te nebo Enkai; nirara intae enkurma enye, airara enkaji Enkai.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore te nkaraki empiris naaishoo Enkai, atotiwuo nanu anaa olashetani arriyia aitobir enkitamanyunoto; likae taata oshetisho te ine. Toduaa naa ake pooki tung'ani eninkunaa enchetata ino te ine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Meetae hoo oloidim anyaaki aitamanyu ae kitamanyunoto neme enapake naidipaki aatipik, naa ninye Yesu Kristo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake te naa keshetaki likae ena kitamanyunoto sahabu, anaa enkosholai, anaa sooito le tipat, aashu nkeek, aashu olkujita, aashu suut, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kelioyu kenyake esiaai o ltung'ani. Amu keyooki akenyu ina olong te nkima naibalunye enatiu esiaai o ltung'ani. Ina kima naitisip eneikununo esiaai o ltung'ani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore pee etune enchetata naitayio oltung'ani, netum ilo olekoisiayio lenye; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ore pee eaku etapejoyioki; nemetum olekoisiayio lenye kake keitajeuni ninye enkorrok, kake ketiu anaa oloimunyeki enkima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.3.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
